Sat Oct 31 11:40:00 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.4.2 (still needs boo#1288451)
- Pass LIBEXECDIR to packaging/install.sh, which supports it
  since this release; drop the manual owlyd move.
- Drop Requires: dbus-1: owly talks to the system bus via zbus
  and works with either daemon (dbus-broker has no dbus-1
  provide, so the Require dragged in dbus-daemon everywhere).

