Wed Oct 28 13:17:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package owly 0.4.1 (boo#1288451)
- Install owlyd in /usr/libexec/owly, not upstream's /usr/lib/owly:
  SELinux labels that lib_t, so systemd would run owlyd as init_t,
  which may not use nl80211, and owlyd would find no Wi-Fi card

